            {
                "drawing_id": "569dabd1-99ab-4995-b3de-a2487a1329cd",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"516\" height=\"216\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">R1 &gt; enable\nR1 # config terminal   \nR1(config)#interface g1/0\nR1(config-if)#ip add 192.168.12.1 255.255.255.0\nR1(config-if)#no shutdown\nR1(config-if)#\nR1(config)#do show ip interface\n  Internet address is 192.168.12.1/24\n  Broadcast address is 255.255.255.255\nR1#show ip interface brief\nInterface                  IP-Address      OK? Method Status                Protocol\nFastEthernet0/0            unassigned      YES unset  administratively down down\nGigabitEthernet1/0         192.168.12.1    YES manual up                    up</text></svg>",
                "x": -1069,
                "y": -476,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "478a551e-0b03-437a-8e76-33ec655e14fe",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"516\" height=\"216\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">R2 &gt; enable\nR2 # config terminal   \nR2(config)#interface g1/0\nR2(config-if)#ip add 192.168.12.2 255.255.255.0\nR2(config-if)#no shutdown\nR2(config-if)#\nR2(config)#do show ip interface\n  Internet address is 192.168.12.2/24\n  Broadcast address is 255.255.255.255\nR2(config)#do show ip interface brief\nInterface                  IP-Address      OK? Method Status                Protocol\nFastEthernet0/0            unassigned      YES unset  administratively down down\nGigabitEthernet1/0         192.168.12.2    YES manual up                    up</text></svg>",
                "x": -482,
