                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"294\" height=\"40\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">ICMP = Internet contorl messaging Protocol\nPort Number = 1 </text></svg>",
                "x": 489,
                "y": -109,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "0b2f62b1-93ee-423f-9136-fd7916d17901",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"374\" height=\"56\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">1. PC1 will generate ICMP echo request \nSource MAC   AA                   Destation MAC  ? \nSource IP       192.168.1.1     Destation IP      192.168.1.2</text></svg>",
                "x": 0,
                "y": 212,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "5de14974-5aa0-4390-b8ab-6b73ec6bed78",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"134\" height=\"40\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">IP : 192.168.1.1/24\n      MAC : AA </text></svg>",
                "x": 181,
                "y": 152,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "175a7885-7b33-4ddc-a649-c5ac61ad1eee",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"134\" height=\"40\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">IP : 192.168.1.2/24\n        MAC : BB </text></svg>",
                "x": 415,
                "y": 155,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "6f9008aa-e7ac-47c1-8505-ce74cc6b2944",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"372\" height=\"40\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">ARP = Address Resolution Protocol\nIt is used to find the Target MAC address of the devices</text></svg>",
                "x": 488,
                "y": -64,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "5cab1ddd-c2b2-495f-ac79-b1d86aa159eb",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"341\" height=\"56\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">2. ARP Request\nSender Mac\tAA\t   Target Mac FF:FF:FF:FF:FF \nSender IP\t192.168.1.1\t   Targer IP 192.168.1.2</text></svg>",
                "x": -1,
                "y": 280,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "1d43ab64-9119-4381-9175-f4687ce98efb",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"385\" height=\"88\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">3. ARP Reply\nSender Mac\t BB\t   Target Mac AA \nSender IP\t192.168.1.2\t   Targer IP 192.168.1.1\nThen the switch will save in the MAC address in MAC table\nThen the PC 1 will save the MAC address in ARP table</text></svg>",
                "x": 0,
                "y": 342,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "60e9aae0-41af-4c40-bc70-1464cb6f83ab",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"374\" height=\"56\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">5. PC2 will generate ICMP echo reply \nSource MAC   BB                   Destation MAC   AA\nSource IP       192.168.1.2     Destation IP      192.168.1.1</text></svg>",
                "x": 419,
                "y": 272,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "cc552375-1d33-448a-a977-b69f9c829a58",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"374\" height=\"56\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">4. PC1 will generate ICMP echo request \nSource MAC   AA                   Destation MAC  BB \nSource IP       192.168.1.1     Destation IP      192.168.1.2</text></svg>",
                "x": 420,
                "y": 213,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
