                "svg": "<svg width=\"402\" height=\"56\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">What is Ping: \n\tPing is Nothing but reachability between devices\n\tin this it show the latenct and round trip times</text></svg>",
